ular shape\n5738-subset: mpath_slim\n5739-is_obsolete: true\n5740-\n5741-[Term]\n5742:id: PATO:0000941\n5743-name: vacuolated\n5744-def: \"A structural quality inhering in a cytoplasm that contains fluid filled cavities.\" [PATOC:mh]\n5745-subset: cell_quality\n--\n5749-\n5750-[Term]\n5751:id: PATO:0000944\n5752-name: sharpness\n5753-def: \"A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's having a sharp or tapered end or point.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5754-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n5758-\n5759-[Term]\n5760:id: PATO:0000945\n5761-name: epinastic\n5762-def: \"A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's exhibiting a downward bending of its leaves or other plant parts.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5763-subset: value_slim\n--\n5765-\n5766-[Term]\n5767:id: PATO:0000946\n5768-name: oblong\n5769-def: \"A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's having a somewhat elongated form with approximately parallel sides.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5770-subset: cell_quality\n--\n5774-\n5775-[Term]\n5776:id: PATO:0000947\n5777-name: elliptic\n5778-def: \"A spheroid quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being oval with two axes of symmetry, as produced by a conical section.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5779-subset: cell_quality\n--\n5788-\n5789-[Term]\n5790:id: PATO:0000948\n5791-name: heart shaped\n5792-def: \"A concave 3-D shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's having a sinus or rounded lobe at the base.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5793-comment: Having the shape of heart.\n--\n5799-\n5800-[Term]\n5801:id: PATO:0000949\n5802-name: fasciated\n5803-def: \"A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being abnormally flattened or coalesced.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5804-subset: cell_quality\n--\n5808-\n5809-[Term]\n5810:id: PATO:0000950\n5811-name: grey\n5812-def: \"A color between white and black colors.\" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grey]\n5813-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5817-\n5818-[Term]\n5819:id: PATO:0000951\n5820-name: purple\n5821-def: \"A color that falls about midway between red and blue in hue.\" [Dictionary:http\\://dictionary.reference.com/]\n5822-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5825-\n5826-[Term]\n5827:id: PATO:0000952\n5828-name: brown\n5829-def: \"A color consisting of dark orange, red, of very low intensity.\" [Wikipedia:http\\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown]\n5830-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5833-\n5834-[Term]\n5835:id: PATO:0000953\n5836-name: orange\n5837-def: \"A color hue with high-medium wavelength that of that portion of the visible spectrum lying between red and yellow, evoked in the human observer by radiant energy with wavelengths of approximately 585 to 620 nanometers.\" [Wikipedia:http\\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orange]\n5838-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5841-\n5842-[Term]\n5843:id: PATO:0000954\n5844-name: pink\n5845-def: \"Red color having medium to high brightness and low to moderate saturation.\" [PATOC:MAH]\n5846-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5849-\n5850-[Term]\n5851:id: PATO:0000955\n5852-name: fertile\n5853-def: \"A fertility quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being capable of initiating, sustaining, or supporting reproduction.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5854-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n5859-\n5860-[Term]\n5861:id: PATO:0000956\n5862-name: sterile\n5863-def: \"A fertility quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being incapable of initiating, sustaining, or supporting reproduction.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5864-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n5868-\n5869-[Term]\n5870:id: PATO:0000957\n5871-name: opacity\n5872-def: \"An optical quality which obtains by virtue of the ability of the bearer to absorb visible light.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5873-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n5875-\n5876-[Term]\n5877:id: PATO:0000958\n5878-name: obsolete opacity value\n5879-is_obsolete: true\n5880-\n5881-[Term]\n5882:id: PATO:0000959\n5883-name: obsolete relative opacity\n5884-is_obsolete: true\n5885-\n5886-[Term]\n5887:id: PATO:0000960\n5888-name: obsolete absolute opacity\n5889-is_obsolete: true\n5890-\n5891-[Term]\n5892:id: PATO:0000961\n5893-name: obsolete relative opacity value\n5894-is_obsolete: true\n5895-\n5896-[Term]\n5897:id: PATO:0000962\n5898-name: obsolete absolute opacity value\n5899-is_obsolete: true\n5900-\n5901-[Term]\n5902:id: PATO:0000963\n5903-name: opaque\n5904-def: \"A optical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's not being clear; not transmitting or reflecting light or radiant energy.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5905-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5912-\n5913-[Term]\n5914:id: PATO:0000964\n5915-name: transparent\n5916-def: \"A optical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's lacking opacity.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5917-subset: mpath_slim\n--\n5923-\n5924-[Term]\n5925:id: PATO:0000965\n5926-name: symmetry\n5927-def: \"A pattern quality of inhering in a bearer by virtue of the correspondence in size, shape, and relative position of the bearer's parts on opposite sides of a dividing line or median plane or about a center or axis.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5928-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n5930-\n5931-[Term]\n5932:id: PATO:0000966\n5933-name: obsolete symmetry value\n5934-is_obsolete: true\n5935-\n5936-[Term]\n5937:id: PATO:0000967\n5938-name: undulate\n5939-alt_id: PATO:0001610\n5940-alt_id: PATO:0001939\n--\n5952-\n5953-[Term]\n5954:id: PATO:0000968\n5955-name: obsolete albino value\n5956-is_obsolete: true\n5957-\n5958-[Term]\n5959:id: PATO:0000969\n5960-name: dwarf-like\n5961-def: \"A size quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being abnormally small.\" [Answers.com:Answers.com]\n5962-subset: value_slim\n--\n5965-\n5966-[Term]\n5967:id: PATO:0000970\n5968-name: permeability\n5969-def: \"A structural quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's disposition to being permeated or pervaded by a gas or liquid (as by osmosis or diffusion).\" [Biology-online:Biology-online]\n5970-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n5974-\n5975-[Term]\n5976:id: PATO:0000971\n5977-name: obsolete absolute permeability\n5978-is_obsolete: true\n5979-\n5980-[Term]\n5981:id: PATO:0000972\n5982-name: obsolete relative permeability\n5983-is_obsolete: true\n5984-\n5985-[Term]\n5986:id: PATO:0000973\n5987-name: porosity\n5988-def: \"A structure quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's disposition to admit the passage of gas or liquid through pores or interstices.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n5989-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n5993-\n5994-[Term]\n5995:id: PATO:0000974\n5996-name: obsolete relative porosity\n5997-is_obsolete: true\n5998-\n5999-[Term]\n6000:id: PATO:0000975\n6001-name: obsolete absolute porosity\n6002-is_obsolete: true\n6003-\n6004-[Term]\n6005:id: PATO:0000976\n6006-name: obsolete permeability value\n6007-is_obsolete: true\n6008-\n6009-[Term]\n6010:id: PATO:0000977\n6011-name: obsolete absolute permeability value\n6012-is_obsolete: true\n6013-\n6014-[Term]\n6015:id: PATO:0000978\n6016-name: obsolete relative permeability value\n6017-is_obsolete: true\n6018-\n6019-[Term]\n6020:id: PATO:0000979\n6021-name: obsolete porosity value\n6022-is_obsolete: true\n6023-\n6024-[Term]\n6025:id: PATO:0000980\n6026-name: obsolete absolute porosity value\n6027-is_obsolete: true\n6028-\n6029-[Term]\n6030:id: PATO:0000981\n6031-name: obsolete relative porosity value\n6032-is_obsolete: true\n6033-\n6034-[Term]\n6035:id: PATO:0000982\n6036-name: permeable\n6037-def: \"A permeability quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being capable to be permeated or pervaded by a gas or liquid (as by osmosis or diffusion).\" [Biology-online:Biology-online]\n6038-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n6044-\n6045-[Term]\n6046:id: PATO:0000983\n6047-name: impermeable\n6048-def: \"A permeability quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being incapable of being permeated or pervaded by a gas or liquid (as by osmosis or diffusion).\" [Biology-online:Biology-online]\n6049-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n6053-\n6054-[Term]\n6055:id: PATO:0000984\n6056-name: porous\n6057-def: \"A porosity quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being capable of admitting the passage of gas or liquid through pores or interstices.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n6058-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n6063-\n6064-[Term]\n6065:id: PATO:0000985\n6066-name: non-porous\n6067-def: \"A porosity quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being incapable of admitting the passage of gas or liquid through pores or interstices.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n6068-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n6072-\n6073-[Term]\n6074:id: PATO:0000986\n6075-name: obsolete absolute consistency\n6076-is_obsolete: true\n6077-\n6078-[Term]\n6079:id: PATO:0000987\n6080-name: obsolete relative consistency\n6081-is_obsolete: true\n6082-\n6083-[Term]\n6084:id: PATO:0000988\n6085-name: obsolete relative consistency value\n6086-is_obsolete: true\n6087-\n6088-[Term]\n6089:id: PATO:0000989\n6090-name: obsolete absolute consistency value\n6091-is_obsolete: true\n6092-\n6093-[Term]\n6094:id: PATO:0000990\n6095-name: obsolete consistent\n6096-is_obsolete: true\n6097-\n6098-[Term]\n6099:id: PATO:0000991\n6100-name: obsolete inconsistent\n6101-is_obsolete: true\n6102-\n6103-[Term]\n6104:id: PATO:0000992\n6105-name: viscosity\n6106-def: \"A physical quality of a fluid inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's disposition to internal resistance to flow.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n6107-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n6110-\n6111-[Term]\n6112:id: PATO:0000993\n6113-name: obsolete relative viscosity\n6114-is_obsolete: true\n6115-\n6116-[Term]\n6117:id: PATO:0000994\n6118-name: obsolete absolute viscosity\n6119-is_obsolete: true\n6120-\n6121-[Term]\n6122:id: PATO:0000995\n6123-name: obsolete viscosity value\n6124-is_obsolete: true\n6125-\n6126-[Term]\n6127:id: PATO:0000996\n6128-name: obsolete absolute viscosity value\n6129-is_obsolete: true\n6130-\n6131-[Term]\n6132:id: PATO:0000997\n6133-name: obsolete relative viscosity value\n6134-is_obsolete: true\n6135-\n6136-[Term]\n6137:id: PATO:0000998\n6138-name: viscous\n6139-def: \"A viscosity quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's having viscosity.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n6140-subset: disposition_slim\n--\n6144-\n6145-[Term]\n6146:id: PATO:0000999\n6147-name: alternation\n6148-def: \"A quality of a single process inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's successive change from one thing or state to another and back again.\" [WordNet:WordNet]\n6149-subset: value_slim\n--\n6151-\n6152-[Term]\n6153:id: PATO:0001000\n6154-name: obsolete relative alternation\n6155-is_obsolete: true\n6156-\n6157-[Term]\n6158:id: PATO:0001001\n6159-name: obsolete absolute alternation\n6160-is_obsolete: true\n6161-\n6162-[Term]\n6163:id: PATO:0001002\n6164-name: obsolete alternation value\n6165-is_obsolete: true\n6166-\n6167-[Term]\n6168:id: PATO:0001003\n6169-name: obsolete relative alternation value\n6170-is_obsolete: true\n6171-\n6172-[Term]\n6173:id: PATO:0001004\n6174-name: obsolete absolute alternation value\n6175-is_obsolete: true\n6176-\n6177-[Term]\n6178:id: PATO:0001005\n6179-name: latency\n6180-def: \"A time quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the time it elapses for the bearer to respond to a stimulus.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n6181-comment: This class is a candidate for obsoletion. The definition is not clear, and the placement under \"delayed\" is not consistent with the definition.\n--\n6184-\n6185-[Term]\n6186:id: PATO:0001006\n6187-name: obsolete absolute latency\n6188-is_obsolete: true\n6189-\n6190-[Term]\n6191:id: PATO:0001007\n6192-name: obsolete relative latency\n6193-is_obsolete: true\n6194-\n6195-[Term]\n6196:id: PATO:0001008\n6197-name: obsolete absolute latency value\n6198-is_obsolete: true\n6199-\n6200-[Term]\n6201:id: PATO:0001009\n6202-name: obsolete relative latency value\n6203-is_obsolete: true\n6204-\n6205-[Term]\n6206:id: PATO:0001010\n6207-name: obsolete relative intensity\n6208-is_obsolete: true\n6209-\n6210-[Term]\n6211:id: PATO:0001011\n6212-name: obsolete absolute intensity\n6213-is_obsolete: true\n6214-\n6215-[Term]\n6216:id: PATO:0001012\n6217-name: obsolete relative intensity value\n6218-is_obsolete: true\n6219-\n6220-[Term]\n6221:id: PATO:0001013\n6222-name: obsolete absolute intensity value\n6223-is_obsolete: true\n6224-\n6225-[Term]\n6226:id: PATO:0001014\n6227-name: obsolete absolute occurence\n6228-is_obsolete: true\n6229-\n6230-[Term]\n6231:id: PATO:0001015\n6232-name: obsolete relative occurence\n6233-is_obsolete: true\n6234-\n6235-[Term]\n6236:id: PATO:0001016\n6237-name: obsolete absolute occurence value\n6238-is_obsolete: true\n6239-\n6240-[Term]\n6241:id: PATO:0001017\n6242-name: obsolete relative occurence value\n6243-is_obsolete: true\n6244-\n6245-[Term]\n6246:id: PATO:0001018\n6247-name: physical quality\n6248-alt_id: PATO:0002079\n6249-def: \"A quality of a physical entity that exists through action of continuants at the physical level of organisation in relation to other entities.\" [PATOC:GVG]\n--\n6254-\n6255-[Term]\n6256:id: PATO:0001019\n6257-name: mass density\n6258-def: \"A physical quality which inheres in a bearer by virtue of some influence is exerted by the bearer's mass per unit size.\" [WordNet:WordNet]\n6259-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n6263-\n6264-[Term]\n6265:id: PATO:0001020\n6266-name: damage\n6267-def: \"A structural quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of whether the bearer has been harmed or injured or spoiled.\" [WordNet:WordNet]\n6268-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n6270-\n6271-[Term]\n6272:id: PATO:0001021\n6273-name: energy\n6274-def: \"A physical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's capacity to do work.\" [Wikipedia:http\\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Energy]\n6275-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n6278-\n6279-[Term]\n6280:id: PATO:0001022\n6281-name: impulse\n6282-def: \"A physical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the amount of momentum caused a certain force will produce over time.\" [url:http\\://www.wikipremed.com/home_resources/010104_momentum_concepts.pdf]\n6283-subset: attribute_slim\n--\n6286-\n6287-[Term]\n6288:id: PATO:0001023\n6289-name: momentum\n6290-def: \"A physical quality inhering in a bearer b